	(descr "Littelfuse SMF5.0A SOD-123FL. Land per Littelfuse SMF series data sheet (rev 05/15/20, study-1-2s/dl/ds/smf3.pdf) p5 'Dimensions - SOD-123FL' (A body 2.50-2.90, D 1.50-2.00, B overall 3.40-3.90) and 'Mounting Pad Layout' (1.3 x 1.4 lands, 1.6 gap). pad centres +-(0.8 + 0.65) = +-1.45; pad 1 = cathode (KiCad convention; D1 uses Device:D_Zener, 1 = K); the OpenDrone model rotation 180 drew the band over pad 2, turned back to 0 so the band sits on pad 1; body = nominal A x D. Corrected copy of OpenDrone:SOD-123FL_L2.7-W1.8-LS3.7-RD (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/SOD-123FL_L2.7-W1.8-LS3.7-RD_W.json")
